        "description": "Neurological manifestations including hypotonia or developmental delay",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of congenital microcoria and congenital nephrotic syndrome with confirmed LAMB2 gene mutation",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is essential for definitive diagnosis; renal biopsy may show diffuse mesangial sclerosis."
